#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:10 8f728a21f4b34dab8f3857cb5909d210
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:12 828f4653defc4d349607514e85b6e85d
msgid ""
"Plane has a wide range of built in flight modes. Plane can act as a "
"simple flight stabilization system, a sophisticated autopilot, a training"
" system or a flight safety system depending on what flight mode and "
"options you choose."
msgstr "Plane 内置了多种飞行模式，可根据所选飞行模式和选项，用作简单的飞行稳定系统、复杂的飞控系统、训练系统或飞行安全系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:17 36693c2b861d42dd97295a6c8c76a54a
msgid ""
"Flight modes are controlled through a :ref:`radio transmitter switch "
"<common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>`, via mission commands,"
" or using commands from a ground station (GCS) or companion computer."
msgstr ""
"飞行模式可通过 :ref:`遥控器开关 <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>` "
"、任务命令或来自地面站（GCS）或伴侣计算机的命令进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:22 616158908c5547e3b8e1e9453c3e8d96
msgid "Major Flight Modes"
msgstr "主要飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:24 13df6dc7fc634a7e9f4c3f83fd5dbcae
msgid ""
"All of the flight modes below have optional additional controls that may "
"be used to change the behaviour to suit particular flying needs. After "
"you have read the introductory material below it is highly recommended "
"that you look through the complete set of :doc:`Plane parameters "
"<parameters>` so you can explore the full range of functionality "
"available."
msgstr ""
"以下所有飞行模式均有可选的附加控制项，可用于针对特定飞行需求调整行为。阅读以下介绍材料后，强烈建议查阅完整的 :doc:`Plane 参数 "
"<parameters>` 集，以探索全部可用功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:64 7652e3f08eea40f593b21314fa47fd69
msgid ""
"Automatic throttle controlled modes can optionally have pilot-based speed"
" adjustments using the throttle stick via the "
":ref:`THROTTLE_NUDGE<THROTTLE_NUDGE>` parameter. Otherwise, the autopilot"
" will attempt to maintain :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` "
"airspeed if an airspeed sensor is being used, or "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` as a target throttle, as in FBWA and "
"CRUISE modes."
msgstr ""
"自动油门控制模式可通过 :ref:`THROTTLE_NUDGE<THROTTLE_NUDGE>` "
"参数选择性地允许飞手用油门摇杆调整速度。否则，飞控将在使用空速传感器时尝试维持 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` 空速，或如 FBWA 和 CRUISE 模式中，以 "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` 作为目标油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:66 285e414910764cd0a45e56214640bf7a
msgid ""
"Most altitude controlled modes can optionally maintain altitude with "
"respect to Terrain instead of relative to HOME. See :ref:`common-terrain-"
"following` for more information."
msgstr "大多数高度控制模式可选择相对于地形而非相对于 Home 点来维持高度。详见 :ref:`common-terrain-following`。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:71 14b1697a317846bb91a896f4121cf7d2
msgid ""
"Any stabilized control mode requires tuning for optimal performance. The "
"default PID and TECS values are very conservative to avoid uncontrollable"
" oscillations. Perform an :ref:`AUTOTUNE <automatic-tuning-with-"
"autotune>` before using stabilized or automatic roll and pitch modes "
"extensively. :ref:`Tune TECS <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-"
"height-tuning-guide>` before using automatic throttle modes extensively."
msgstr ""
"任何稳定控制模式都需要调参以获得最优性能。默认的 PID 和 TECS "
"值非常保守，以避免不可控的震荡。在大量使用稳定或自动横滚俯仰模式之前，请先执行 :ref:`AUTOTUNE <automatic-tuning-"
"with-autotune>`。在大量使用自动油门模式之前，请先 :ref:`调整 TECS <tecs-total-energy-"
"control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:77 2456302469774798984969efc39c2787
msgid ""
"AUTO mode also provides for :ref:`automatic-takeoff` and :ref:`automatic-"
"landing`."
msgstr "AUTO 模式还支持 :ref:`automatic-takeoff` 和 :ref:`automatic-landing`。"

